  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここ、昔宿屋だったの
でも、人が来ないから
つぶれちゃった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This used to be an inn
but no one ever stayed
there, so they went bankrupt.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダメね、田舎って
商売向きじゃないわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't run a real business
out in the sticks, you know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村、物価が安くて
とても住みやすいのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The cost of living's nice
and cheap in this village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ろくな商品ないけどね
あ～あ、大きな町に
引っ越したい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But no one sells any of the real
high-quality goods. Ahh, I'd
love to move to a bigger town...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの人、
またしょうもないこと
始めようとしてるのよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My husband seems to
be trying to start another
one of his useless ventures.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな田舎で
何しようってんだか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's he think he'll accomplish
in such a rural little place?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの人こりないのよね
あれやこれや
手を出して結局失敗</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My husband's hopelessly stubborn,
though. He's tried a whole lot
of things and fails at every one.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、そこに惚れたから
私も文句言えないのよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's what made me fall for him,
so... I can't really criticize him for it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今、ちょっと
客寄せと金儲けを
考えてるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right now, I'm thinking
of some ways to pull
customers and turn a profit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何かって？
教えたら盗まれるから
教えないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're my ideas? Well,
if I told you that, you'd
steal them, so I won't.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、しつこいな
……まったく
しょうがねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're pretty damn persistent,
huh? ...Alright, fine, I'll tell you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒントだけ
『戦い』……
さぁ、血湧き肉踊るぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just a hint. "Battle." It already gets
your blood pumping, right!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この街を発展させる……
客を呼びこんで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll help develop this village...
Get plenty of new customers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>強いヤツらも集めて……
魔物もいいかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lots of strong guys...
Maybe some monsters, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はっ……
立ち聞きするなよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh... Hey, quit
listening in on me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、しつこいな
村の名物ってやつを
作るんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're pretty damn persistent,
huh? I'm planning something that'll
put this village on the map.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それはな……
いや、なんでもない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm going to... Wait, no,
I'm not gonna tell you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
